1
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:31,320
I was just checking the accounts.

2
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:34,000
Paradise Funeral Home is doing pretty well lately.

3
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,680
I'm wondering

4
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,480
if we should bring in AI technology

5
00:01:38,480 --> 00:01:39,880
to see if we can create a new product.

6
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,480
Don't copy Ronghua's playbook.

7
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:42,480
They

8
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,960
just use the dead to rip people off.

9
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:45,080
But I

10
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:47,000
genuinely want

11
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,440
to offer comfort and blessings to the departed.

12
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,200
What are you glaring at me for?

13
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,080
If we don't generate revenue,

14
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:56,360
what will happen to Paradise Funeral Home?

15
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,440
You and my brother really are

16
00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:00,080
a pair of ungrateful jerks.

17
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,880
I think you and your brother are the real siblings here.

18
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:05,440
One of you never says a word,

19
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:06,560
and the other has a venomous tongue.

20
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,680
You're really something.

21
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,320
Speaking of which,

22
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:14,320
where did that guy run off to?

23
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:17,120
He hasn't been home all day.

24
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,360
He's probably out on some street again,

25
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,680
helping old ladies cross the road.

26
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:23,880
Exactly.

27
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:26,160
I called him today,

28
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:27,520
and he didn't answer a single time.

29
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:29,440
Is he out fooling around somewhere?

30
00:02:29,440 --> 00:02:31,520
He's always slacking off.

31
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,760
If he doesn't show up,

32
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:34,520
even better.

33
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,200
Dad,

34
00:02:37,640 --> 00:02:40,480
you were the one who asked him to stay.

35
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,240
Are you trying to kick him out now?

36
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:46,040
Once he pays the money back,

37
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,720
he can leave anytime.

38
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:51,280
Why would I keep him around?

39
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,880
Don't lose hope.

40
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:13,280
Maybe tomorrow,

41
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,520
an opportunity will just pop right up.

42
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:16,560
"Tomorrow" again.

43
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:20,680
How many "tomorrows" have we said since graduation?

44
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,040
Baixi, I really can't take it anymore.

45
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:27,000
Wake up.

46
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:38,000
Uncle Chen, Xiaofang.

47
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,360
I'm still really curious.

48
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,920
Why exactly did he come back from Beijing?

49
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,440
Actually,

50
00:03:43,440 --> 00:03:45,160
I really have asked him many times.

51
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,520
But he says something different every time.

52
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,520
The most ridiculous time,

53
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:52,000
he said he got blacklisted by a sugar mama.

54
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:54,200
What a joke.

55
00:03:58,720 --> 00:03:59,560
If you ask me,

56
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,120
why else?

57
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:05,240
He probably just couldn't cut it out there.

58
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,560
I think so too.

59
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,320
You changed.

60
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,880
Where's the floral dress you wore out this morning?

61
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,160
You don't need to say it, I know.

62
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,040
I saw it all.

63
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,200
He dropped you off right at our door.

64
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,560
You didn't even try to hide it.

65
00:04:41,880 --> 00:04:43,280
I didn't plan on hiding it from you anyway.

66
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,200
Wu Huilian.

67
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:47,760
I don't mind you being with Uncle Daren.

68
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:49,080
If you want to choose Boss Jiang,

69
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:49,840
I... I...

70
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,520
I can accept that.

71
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:52,360
Because it's your choice.

72
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,400
I'm willing to respect that.

73
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:54,400
But... but...

74
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:55,880
You can't two-time them.

75
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,600
What am I supposed to say to you?

76
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,800
When did I ever two-time anyone?

77
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,960
Explain yourself.

78
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,520
I heard everything the other day.

79
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,080
Didn't you say to Uncle Daren...

80
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:05,840
Say what?

81
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,680
"Go back and think it over carefully.

82
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,880
Be brave and take the first step."

83
00:05:08,880 --> 00:05:09,840
Didn't you say that?

84
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,760
And today you went on a date with Boss Jiang.

85
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:12,840
You're such a player.

86
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,640
I'm a player?

87
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,200
Yeah!

88
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:24,000
When did I ever play Uncle Daren?

89
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:26,760
If you don't trust me, don't you trust him?

90
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,040
Fine.

91
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,160
Then please explain to me,

92
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:32,680
what were you doing with Boss Jiang today?

93
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,880
Were you on a date?

94
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,200
If there's nothing going on between you two,

95
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:36,640
why did he drop you off right at the door?

96
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,960
And why would he give you a new outfit?

97
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:38,600
Don't tell me

98
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,720
you bought it yourself.

99
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,720
He was pursuing me.

100
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:53,800
I rejected him.

101
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,640
I've already made it clear to him.

102
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:56,840
He...

103
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:58,440
was pursuing you?

104
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,280
Is he crazy?

105
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,520
In the whole world,

106
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:08,040
you're the only one who can't see your mom's charm.

107
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:12,760
Old Li.

108
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,560
Old Li, take a good look.

109
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,880
I'm really at my wits' end.

110
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:18,560
Old Li,

111
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,440
don't worry.

112
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,560
I haven't done anything to betray you.

113
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,440
Rest in peace down there.

114
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:25,760
I'm completely devoted to you.

115
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:27,360
I'd never be unfaithful.

116
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:34,920
No dating, no getting married,

117
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:35,760
no having kids.

118
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,680
When I was your age,

119
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:39,160
you could already recite the times tables.

120
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:39,880
You know?

121
00:06:41,880 --> 00:06:42,640
Hilarious.

122
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:44,160
And now you're bossing me around.

123
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,160
Really?

124
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:49,160
Could I recite them that early?

125
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:52,520
Is that the point, Wu Huilan?

126
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:53,920
Every time I criticize you, you criticize me.

127
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:54,960
You always turn it around on me.

128
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:55,760
Why are you so relentless?

129
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:56,800
Why are you being so unreasonable?

130
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,240
Ten.

131
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,600
Queen.

132
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,280
Pass.

133
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:04,800
Can't even beat a Queen.

134
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,240
Honey!

135
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,840
I bought your favorite roasted chestnuts.

136
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:11,920
Brother-in-law!

137
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:13,120
You and Dad are here too.

138
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,280
What are you playing?

139
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,640
Fight the Landlord.

140
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,960
Fighting the damn landlord.

141
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,640
Honey, have some.

142
00:07:23,200 --> 00:07:24,200
You're just in time.

143
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,840
Tell my dad and my brother

144
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,360
about your blind dates.

145
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,480
Why go on blind dates when you're married?

146
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,520
Filthy scumbag.

147
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,640
I know you're still mad at me.

148
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,880
I came here specifically to apologize.

149
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,000
No need to look for me.

150
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:46,160
Go find your well-matched rich heiress.

151
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,240
A five.

152
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:55,000
The cooling-off period just ended,

153
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,880
and you're already trying to make a comeback?

154
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,240
Pass.

155
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:07,600
Dad,

156
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,960
I bought this massager especially for you.

157
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:09,960
It's really comfortable.

158
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,240
I wouldn't dare.

159
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,840
Who's your dad?

160
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:15,640
You use these petty favors

161
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,920
to buy me off?

162
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:18,480
Last time,

163
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,600
you tricked Xiaofang

164
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,120
into getting married.

165
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:22,520
I haven't settled that score with you yet.

166
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,360
Dad,

167
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,840
tricking Xiaofang was indeed my fault.

168
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:27,880
But

169
00:08:27,920 --> 00:08:30,240
I just wanted to marry Xiaofang so badly

170
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,720
that I resorted to such a bad idea.

171
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:33,960
What you did was wrong.

172
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:36,000
No matter how nicely you put it,

173
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,280
it won't work.

174
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,800
My dad's right.

175
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:42,680
Keep playing.

176
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:45,880
Whose turn is it?

177
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:52,040
Does that mean only if I die,

178
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:53,480
I can prove my sincerity?

179
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:56,280
The river is just a left turn out the door.

180
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,320
See yourself out.

181
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:59,880
If you really do pass away,

182
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,320
have your family contact us.

183
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,560
We'll handle your funeral arrangements.

184
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:06,160
That's something we're actually good at.

185
00:09:10,560 --> 00:09:11,360
Ten.

186
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:20,760
Were we a bit too harsh just now?

187
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,800
He was way worse to me.

188
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:23,880
Let's keep going.

189
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:24,720
Just ignore him.

190
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:25,880
Ten.

191
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,200
We should still check on him.

192
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,320
I said ignore him!

193
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,240
Ignore him.

194
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,520
He's an adult.

195
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:32,320
You.

196
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:34,040
He's the landlord.

197
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,000
To all my single friends here,

198
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:40,800
hello everyone!

199
00:09:41,880 --> 00:09:43,320
Come on, give us a smile!

200
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:44,040
What's the matter?

201
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:45,320
Haven't found a partner?

202
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:47,040
Why all the long faces?

203
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,440
How about I put on a little show for you all?

204
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,320
Clap your hands!

205
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,520
Give me some encouragement!

206
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,520
A partner!

207
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:58,720
Do you want to find one?

208
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,400
Get a matchmaker to help you out!

209
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:01,160
What a clown.

210
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:04,320
I'm Huilan, fast and efficient!

211
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:05,840
A husband!

212
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:06,920
Do you want to find one?

213
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,720
Let me, Huilan, help you out!

214
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,680
Tall and handsome,

215
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:10,520
and totally devoted,

216
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:12,000
and a great cook too!

217
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,040
A wife!

218
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,240
Do you want to find one?

219
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:16,120
Let me, Huilan, help you out!

220
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,400
Gentle and virtuous,

221
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,400
understanding and kind,

222
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:20,000
and absolutely beautiful!

223
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,920
If you want to find a partner,

224
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:23,680
fill out a form right now!

225
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,800
Fill it out right now!

226
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:27,120
Staff, hurry up and hand out the forms!

227
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,120
Just fill it out,

228
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:29,240
and we'll see

229
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:31,240
who's truly serious about finding love.

230
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,840
Make sure you fill it out carefully.

231
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:37,520
All that nonsense and not a single successful match.

232
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:39,400
Still better than you!

233
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,600
Sitting there doing nothing, you bastard!

234
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:44,040
Who are you calling a bastard?

235
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,480
I'm calling you a bastard!

236
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,920
Got a problem with that?

237
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,720
A good man doesn't fight with women.

238
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:53,800
Old Wu,

239
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,120
Young Boss Zhou,

240
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:57,640
Mr. Zhou,

241
00:11:00,520 --> 00:11:01,320
come here.

242
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,520
I need to talk to you about something.

243
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,360
What's up, Boss Zhou?

244
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,320
Auntie Huilan.

245
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,880
I don't care if you laugh at me for this.

246
00:11:15,880 --> 00:11:17,320
Xiaofang and I...

247
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,200
...just got past our divorce cooling-off period.

248
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,760
But she's still ignoring me.

249
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:22,360
I'm totally out of ideas.

250
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,400
Forced love...

251
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:25,400
...never lasts.

252
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:28,640
We truly love each other, Auntie Huilan.

253
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:32,720
You two truly love each other?

254
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,960
Breaking up one minute, making up the next.

255
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:35,520
Breaking up one minute, making up the next.

256
00:11:35,520 --> 00:11:36,760
Is that what you call true love?

257
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:38,480
Look at those...

258
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:40,160
...black swans in the lake.

259
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:41,440
They're together every day.

260
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,920
The affection between those two...

261
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:43,920
...is way stronger than yours.

262
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:45,720
You've been through this.

263
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,920
You must know what to do.

264
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:49,680
There's nothing I can do.

265
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,560
Double year-end bonus.

266
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:58,240
Don't try to tempt me with money.

267
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:02,200
I might not even last until the end of the year.

268
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:06,320
A permanent position.

269
00:12:08,640 --> 00:12:09,440
Okay.

270
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:10,480
No problem.

271
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:11,520
I'll make you permanent right away.

272
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:14,640
Then...

273
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,720
...it's a deal.

274
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,320
I'll go work hard now.

275
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,720
I'll be waiting for my permanent contract.

276
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:21,520
Alright.

277
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:22,520
Think hard of a plan for me.

278
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:25,240
Keep making a fool of yourself.

279
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:25,760
Get lost!

280
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,200
Boss Zhou.

281
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:33,040
Why don't you believe me anymore?

282
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,120
I'm so heartbroken.

283
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,400
Believe what about you?

284
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,720
What did you say?

285
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:39,000
Get back to work.

286
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:42,600
Haven't I given you advice before?

287
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:46,240
