585
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:22,400
Let me tell you,

586
00:29:22,400 --> 00:29:23,280
about this cost of yours,

587
00:29:23,280 --> 00:29:24,400
you can fool others,

588
00:29:24,400 --> 00:29:25,360
but you can't fool me.

589
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:27,240
Xiaofang is a born businesswoman.

590
00:29:28,120 --> 00:29:28,840
