603
00:30:18,520 --> 00:30:19,320
Baixi.

604
00:30:19,480 --> 00:30:22,000
I'm planning to do a series on anti-trafficking.

605
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:22,800
Anti-trafficking?

606
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:24,840
When I was working as a social worker,

607
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:26,720
