618
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:51,960
So, you mean...

619
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:54,360
I mean...

620
00:30:55,200 --> 00:30:56,640
I was hoping we could, together,

621
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:58,480
