678
00:34:36,200 --> 00:34:37,920
We'll make big money together when the time comes.

679
00:34:37,920 --> 00:34:39,760
Well, making money is definitely a good thing, right?

680
00:34:40,040 --> 00:34:41,240
Who doesn't want to make money?

681
00:34:41,800 --> 00:34:42,160
Jiang,

682
00:34:42,160 --> 00:34:43,200
