833
00:41:39,360 --> 00:41:40,160
Oh, my god.

834
00:41:40,160 --> 00:41:41,640
Stop drinking, stop drinking, stop drinking.

835
00:41:41,640 --> 00:41:42,560
This kid...

836
00:41:48,280 --> 00:41:48,640
Uncle Daren.

837
00:41:48,640 --> 00:41:49,400
