00:42:39,320 --> 00:42:41,320
Didn't you introduce this business to us?

859
00:42:41,720 --> 00:42:42,800
In our line of work,

860
00:42:43,600 --> 00:42:44,880
you have to know the rules.

861
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:45,880
Rules?

862
00:42:46,080 --> 00:42:47,600
Money is the only rule.

863
00:42:47,760 --> 00:42:48,560
No money?

864
00:42:48,560 --> 00:42:49,200
Get lost.

865
00:42:52,760 --> 00:42:54,240
Don't worry, Brother Xizi.

866
00:42:54,240 --> 00:42:56,080
We'll definitely give you a cut.

867
00:42:56,080 --> 00:42:57,240
Over an old lady,

868
00:42:57,640 --> 00:42:59,200
let's not ruin our brotherhood.

869
00:42:59,200 --> 00:42:59,720
Right?

870
00:43:01,720 --> 00:43:02,640
Who's your brother?

871
00:43:04,120 --> 00:43:05,560
I've been too nice to you, haven't I?

872
00:43:05,560 --> 00:43:06,240
You wanna go?

873
00:43:06,240 --> 00:43:07,480
Screw you!

874
00:43:10,240 --> 00:43:10,840
What are you doing?!

875
00:43:10,840 --> 00:43:11,600
What's going on?!

876
00:43:11,600 --> 00:43:12,000
Stop!

877
00:43:12,000 --> 00:43:12,440
What're you doing?!

878
00:43:12,440 --> 00:43:13,040
Stop it!

879
00:43:13,360 --> 00:43:14,040
I said break it up!

880
00:43:14,280 --> 00:43:16,000
Stop! Stop it!

881
00:43:16,000 --> 00:43:16,840
What're you doing?!

882
00:43:17,000 --> 00:43:18,800
I learned kung fu when I was younger!

883
00:43:19,640 --> 00:43:20,440
What is wrong with you?!

884
00:43:21,560 --> 00:43:22,400
Cause any more trouble,

885
00:43:22,400 --> 00:43:23,200
and I'm calling the cops!

886
00:43:23,200 --> 00:43:24,760
This is my turf.

887
00:43:25,360 --> 00:43:26,480
If you cause any more trouble,

888
00:43:26,480 --> 00:43:27,600
I'll call the cops!

889
00:43:31,600 --> 00:43:32,400
Let's go, let's go.

890
00:43:32,600 --> 00:43:33,560
I'm calling them!

891
00:43:34,280 --> 00:43:35,200
I really will!

892
00:43:37,400 --> 00:43:37,880
This...

893
00:43:37,880 --> 00:43:38,720
What happened?

894
00:43:39,840 --> 00:43:41,320
Are you okay, brother-in-law?

895
00:43:41,320 --> 00:43:42,000
Are you okay?

896
00:43:42,000 --> 00:43:42,560
I'm fine.

897
00:43:43,160 --> 00:43:45,080
Why didn't you wake me up to fight them?

898
00:43:56,040 --> 00:43:56,720
Here.

899
00:44:01,800 --> 00:44:02,280
Zhou.

900
00:44:02,280 --> 00:44:02,960
I'll do it myself.

901
00:44:02,960 --> 00:44:04,160
Don't trouble yourself.

902
00:44:06,720 --> 00:44:07,920
My dear brother-in-law.

903
00:44:08,240 --> 00:44:09,400
If you can't beat them,

904
00:44:09,400 --> 00:44:10,800
don't force it.

905
00:44:11,120 --> 00:44:11,800
You...

906
00:44:12,160 --> 00:44:13,160
You lost the fight again, didn't you?

907
00:44:13,800 --> 00:44:14,480
Look,

908
00:44:15,560 --> 00:44:17,080
even a cornered rabbit bites.

909
00:44:17,920 --> 00:44:18,760
But you,

910
00:44:18,920 --> 00:44:20,000
all you did was pretend to be drunk.

911
00:44:21,480 --> 00:44:22,880
How was I pretending to be drunk?

912
00:44:22,880 --> 00:44:25,200
I really drank too much because of my breakup!

913
00:44:26,200 --> 00:44:27,080
I'm telling you,

914
00:44:27,680 --> 00:44:29,480
if they hadn't run so fast,

915
00:44:29,600 --> 00:44:31,560
I swear I would've broken their legs.

916
00:44:32,000 --> 00:44:33,200
Those bastards.

917
00:44:35,600 --> 00:44:36,400
Actually,

918
00:44:37,400 --> 00:44:39,040
I'm also mad at myself.

919
00:44:41,000 --> 00:44:44,000
How could I push an innocent old man into the fire?

920
00:44:45,920 --> 00:44:46,600
No,

921
00:44:47,040 --> 00:44:49,000
what fire?

922
00:44:49,440 --> 00:44:51,760
Just pull him out the way you pushed him in.

923
00:44:59,920 --> 00:45:00,720
Zhou.

924
00:45:01,240 --> 00:45:02,600
Smart for once.

925
00:45:05,560 --> 00:45:06,360
What does that mean?

926
00:45:06,440 --> 00:45:07,400
Let's go.

927
00:45:15,160 --> 00:45:17,000
I'm so pissed off right now.

928
00:45:19,440 --> 00:45:20,200
Huilian.

929
00:45:20,200 --> 00:45:21,200
What's wrong with you?

930
00:45:21,720 --> 00:45:23,080
What exactly did Xiaofang say?

931
00:45:23,240 --> 00:45:25,120
Are you still playing dumb with me?

932
00:45:25,360 --> 00:45:26,240
You don't know?

933
00:45:26,400 --> 00:45:27,920
What did you tell Xiaofang?

934
00:45:28,320 --> 00:45:29,400
You liar.

935
00:45:32,520 --> 00:45:35,800
I lied and told Xiaofang my dad approved of our marriage.

936
00:45:36,600 --> 00:45:38,040
But I know I was wrong.

937
00:45:38,080 --> 00:45:40,960
Now she won't forgive me no matter what I say.

938
00:45:41,120 --> 00:45:42,200
Is your mouth

939
00:45:42,680 --> 00:45:44,560
just for blowing hot air?

940
00:45:46,680 --> 00:45:47,480
What do you mean?

941
00:45:47,680 --> 00:45:49,200
You can't just rely on words.

942
00:45:49,560 --> 00:45:51,600
You need to take actual action.

943
00:45:52,480 --> 00:45:54,160
You really are a coward.

944
00:45:54,200 --> 00:45:55,280
Your old man

945
00:45:55,280 --> 00:45:58,360
always says Xiaofang works with the dead.

946
00:45:58,360 --> 00:45:59,840
You just let your old man say that.

947
00:46:00,600 --> 00:46:02,080
You watch your old man hurt Xiaofang.

948
00:46:02,360 --> 00:46:03,240
And you don't even know to say

949
00:46:03,440 --> 00:46:05,360
that Xiaofang is a great girl?

950
00:46:05,600 --> 00:46:06,640
She's very capable,

951
00:46:07,200 --> 00:46:08,280
she's very brave,

952
00:46:08,960 --> 00:46:10,120
and she's very hardworking.

953
00:46:10,200 --> 00:46:11,280
She has so many good qualities,

954
00:46:11,280 --> 00:46:12,840
and you don't know how to tell your old man?

955
00:46:13,680 --> 00:46:14,480
Yeah,

956
00:46:14,600 --> 00:46:18,480
you need to put yourself in Xiaofang's shoes more.

957
00:46:19,640 --> 00:46:21,560
If you truly love Chen Xiaofang,

958
00:46:22,520 --> 00:46:25,960
you should break free from your old man's control, you know?

959
00:46:26,080 --> 00:46:28,120
But Xidongdong has been losing money.

960
00:46:28,120 --> 00:46:29,680
If my dad wasn't funding me,

961
00:46:29,680 --> 00:46:31,600
Xidongdong would've gone bankrupt a long time ago.

962
00:46:31,600 --> 00:46:33,840
Wouldn't you really become the industry jinx then?

963
00:46:40,840 --> 00:46:42,800
Then Xidongdong definitely can't go bankrupt.

964
00:46:43,520 --> 00:46:45,000
If Xidongdong goes bankrupt,

965
00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:46,560
I won't have a job anymore!

966
00:46:47,120 --> 00:46:47,840
You...

967
00:46:48,600 --> 00:46:49,400
Can't you...

968
00:46:49,800 --> 00:46:51,160
Can't you just rely on yourself?

969
00:46:51,160 --> 00:46:52,800
Use your brain and think

970
00:46:52,800 --> 00:46:55,400
about how to make Xidongdong profitable on its own!

971
00:46:59,280 --> 00:47:00,000
You really are...

972
00:47:00,000 --> 00:47:01,880
You guys are giving me a massive headache.

973
00:47:03,800 --> 00:47:04,680
Zhou.

974
00:47:05,560 --> 00:47:06,800
Anyway, I've said

975
00:47:06,800 --> 00:47:08,040
what I needed to say.

976
00:47:08,400 --> 00:47:09,960
If you listen to me,

977
00:47:10,800 --> 00:47:12,320
you and Xiaofang still have a chance.

978
00:47:12,760 --> 00:47:14,440
If you don't listen to me,

979
00:47:14,440 --> 00:47:16,240
you two are done for.

980
00:47:17,040 --> 00:47:17,720
Give me my bag.

981
00:47:23,800 --> 00:47:24,760
Pay the bill.

982
00:47:25,400 --> 00:47:26,720
Don't let someone else pay.

983
00:47:29,200 --> 00:47:29,920
Alright, alright.

984
00:47:29,920 --> 00:47:31,760
It's only 38 yuan.

985
00:47:32,000 --> 00:47:32,600
Zhou,

986
00:47:32,600 --> 00:47:33,360
it's my treat.

987
00:47:33,360 --> 00:47:34,560
D- Daren.

988
00:47:34,640 --> 00:47:36,480
This is all the money I brought today.

989
00:47:37,040 --> 00:47:37,760
This, this...

990
00:47:37,760 --> 00:47:38,600
This is way too much.

991
00:47:38,600 --> 00:47:39,360
I don't need this much.

992
00:47:39,360 --> 00:47:40,120
No.

993
00:47:40,120 --> 00:47:41,680
This meal is worth this much.

994
00:47:49,800 --> 00:47:52,000
This is enough for a whole roasted sheep!

995
00:48:01,400 --> 00:48:02,400
What happened to your face?

996
00:48:04,440 --> 00:48:05,240
It's nothing.

997
00:48:05,640 --> 00:48:06,440
Yiran,

998
00:48:06,840 --> 00:48:08,520
let's take Grandma Xiufang's case.
